{"title":"POA 资源失效和 Git LFS 指针之后：把 files/ 搬到 Cloudflare R2","date":"2026-07-11T03:48:00.000Z","date_formatted":{"ll":"Jul 11, 2026","L":"07/11/2026","MM-DD":"07-11"},"link":"2026/git-lfs-r2-github-pages","comments":true,"tags":["Cloudflare","Git LFS","GitHub Actions","Hexo","R2","技术分享"],"updated":"2026-07-10T21:24:20.647Z","content":"<p>今天有两件原本不相干的事撞到了一起。</p>\n<p>先是群友问有没有适合上班玩的 H5 游戏。我想起之前部署过的 POA JS 版，进去试了一下，发现页面加载不到 asset 文件，游戏本体也认不出这些资源，自然玩不起来。</p>\n<p>不久后有新群友访问 <a href=\"/roguelike/\">Archive RL S</a>，说里面不少文件下载后打不开，而且小得不正常。我自己试了几个，解压不了，拿文本编辑器打开，内容是 Git LFS 的指针：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1</span><br><span class=\"line\">oid sha256:...</span><br><span class=\"line\">size 5044120</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>以弗所的源码在 <code>src</code> 分支。每次 push 后，GitHub Actions 用 Hexo 生成 <code>public/</code>，再推送到 <code>main</code> 分支，GitHub Pages 从 <code>main</code> 发布。<code>source/files/</code> 下面放着 Archive RL S 的各种文件、H5 游戏和它们需要的图片、脚本、字体等资源。</p>\n<p>这条部署流程 checkout 源码时没有取回 LFS 对象。Hexo 不认识 LFS 指针，于是将这段小文本当作普通文件复制到 <code>public/files/</code>；<code>main</code> 又只是静态产物分支，最后下载到的当然还是指针。加上 <code>lfs: true</code> 可以修好这个问题，但所有文件仍会随 Pages 发布。现在 <code>source/files/</code> 有 4826 个文件，其中 154 个由 LFS 管理，继续这么放也很麻烦。</p>\n<p>在这之前，我用讯飞 Coding Plan 的 GLM 5.2 配 Claude Code 出过一版方案。它让我先把以弗所的 nameserver 迁到 Cloudflare，准备以后配 CDN 和 <code>dl.ephesus.top</code>；这一步后来确实用上了。计划在 <code>~/.claude/plans/polished-puzzling-bachman.md</code>，不过它 thinking 了非常久，后面又反复回到差不多的结论。我就先搁着了。</p>\n<p>白天我在 GPT Chat 5.5 上重新问了这两个问题，才注意到 R2 有 10 GB 内、百万次访问量级的免费额度。以弗所现在的情况正好够用。晚上 strange mood 上来，突然就很想把这件事彻底做掉；这时 GPT 5.6 已经能用 Plus 了，便顺手拿来重新做方案和实现。</p>\n<p>最后开了一个 <code>ephesus-files</code> 桶。<code>source/files/</code> 还留在 Git 里，平时怎么放文件、commit、push 都不用变；Actions 在部署前把改动同步到 R2，Pages 则不再带上整个 <code>files/</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"files/-得一起搬\">files/ 得一起搬<a title=\"#files/-得一起搬\" href=\"#files/-得一起搬\"></a></h2>\n<p>我最开始想的是只搬 <code>.zip</code>、<code>.7z</code>、<code>.tar.gz</code>。压缩文件体积大，先把它们挪走看起来很合理。</p>\n<p>但 <code>files/</code> 里还有 <code>leyliner</code>、<code>cataclysmIdle</code>、ADOM 图鉴和 POA 这类直接跑在浏览器里的东西。它们会继续请求 HTML、JS、CSS、png、字体、wasm。要是只把入口文件和压缩包传到 R2，剩下的资源还在 Pages，之后每新增一个没列进规则的后缀就可能炸一次。POA 已经炸过一次了，我不想再维护一张“哪些东西该搬”的名单。</p>\n<p>于是就定成整个 <code>source/files/</code> 镜像到 R2。路径也完全照抄：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">source/files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br><span class=\"line\">                         ↓</span><br><span class=\"line\">R2: files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>桶绑定了 <code>dl.ephesus.top</code>，所以可以直接拿一个文件试试：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">https://dl.ephesus.top/files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>GLM 那版方案还准备把文章和游戏里的 <code>files/...</code> 链接全改掉。以弗所这么多旧页面，肯定改不干净。GPT 5.6 提的办法省心很多：给 <code>www.ephesus.top/files/*</code> 配一个 Worker，把原路径的请求拿去读 R2 里同名的 key。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">www.ephesus.top/files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ↓</span><br><span class=\"line\">Worker</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ↓</span><br><span class=\"line\">ephesus-files 的 files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>浏览器的地址会一直保持在 <code>www.ephesus.top/files/...</code>，Worker 在后面把文件取回来。文章里的链接、POA 和其他 H5 游戏里面的相对路径都不用动。<code>dl.ephesus.top</code> 就留给我直接检查 R2 有没有东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"worker-做了什么\">Worker 做了什么<a title=\"#worker-做了什么\" href=\"#worker-做了什么\"></a></h2>\n<p>Worker 在 <code>workers/ephesus-files-proxy/</code>。配置其实就两件事：绑定 <code>ephesus-files</code>，以及把 <code>www.ephesus.top/files/*</code> 交给它。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ephesus-files-proxy&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;src/index.js&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &quot;workers_dev&quot;: false,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &quot;r2_buckets&quot;: [</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &quot;binding&quot;: &quot;EPHESUS_FILES&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &quot;bucket_name&quot;: &quot;ephesus-files&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ],</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &quot;routes&quot;: [</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;www.ephesus.top/files/*&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &quot;zone_name&quot;: &quot;ephesus.top&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>代码只收 <code>GET</code> 和 <code>HEAD</code>。<code>/files/hxh_civ/3D%20Art.zip</code> 会变成 R2 的 <code>files/hxh_civ/3D Art.zip</code>。空路径、<code>.</code>、<code>..</code> 直接给 404，不让 URL 乱摸 key。</p>\n<p>还有一件不能偷懒的事：Range。浏览器和下载器请求大文件时经常只取其中一段，Worker 得把原请求头传给 R2：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> object = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> env.<span class=\"property\">EPHESUS_FILES</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">get</span>(key, &#123; <span class=\"attr\">range</span>: request.<span class=\"property\">headers</span> &#125;);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>R2 取到范围对象时，Worker 返回 <code>206 Partial Content</code>，并补好 <code>Content-Range</code>、<code>Content-Length</code>、<code>Accept-Ranges</code>。不做这部分，小文件乍看没问题，断点续传和部分下载就会出事。</p>\n<p>R2 里的旧对象有些没有 content type。Worker 会先写回 R2 的 HTTP metadata，再按扩展名给 <code>html</code>、<code>js</code>、<code>css</code>、<code>json</code>、<code>wasm</code>、<code>woff</code>、<code>woff2</code> 兜底。wasm 被浏览器当成普通二进制文件时，H5 游戏同样跑不起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"actions-怎样同步\">Actions 怎样同步<a title=\"#actions-怎样同步\" href=\"#actions-怎样同步\"></a></h2>\n<p>同步脚本在 <code>tools/sync-r2-assets.js</code>。它拿到这次 push 前后的 SHA，先跑：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git diff --name-status -z --find-renames BASE HEAD -- source/files</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>然后给本次同步分三种情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>full</code>：第一次同步、找不到前一个提交，或者手动要求完整同步。</li>\n<li><code>incremental</code>：<code>source/files/</code> 有新增、修改、删除或改名。</li>\n<li><code>none</code>：只改了文章、工作流等不在 <code>source/files/</code> 的内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>文件改名会变成“上传新路径，再删旧路径”。R2 不知道 Git 里的 rename；只传新的，旧文件会一直留在桶里，只删旧的，新链接又打不开。</p>\n<p>完整同步就是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">rclone sync source/files r2:ephesus-files/files \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --fast-list --delete-during --progress</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p><code>sync</code> 会顺便删除 Git 里已经删掉、R2 里却还在的文件。增量模式按 diff 一个个 <code>copyto</code> 或 <code>deletefile</code>。</p>\n<p>LFS 也不用每次全拉。完整同步时：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git lfs pull --include=source/files/**</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>增量同步会先看看改动文件是不是 LFS 指针，只有这种文件才 <code>git lfs pull --include=对应路径</code>。改一篇文章不至于把几 GB 的东西全下回来；只改一个压缩包，也不用把所有 LFS 文件都取一遍。</p>\n<p><code>files/hxh_civ/tree.json</code> 稍微特殊。它由 <code>scripts/gen-hxh-tree.js</code> 生成，内容是目录树，<code>hxh_civ</code> 的文件浏览器会在运行时读它。同步脚本遇到完整同步，或者发现 <code>source/files/hxh_civ/</code> 有改动时，会复用 <code>tools/hxh-tree.js</code> 重新生成 JSON，再传到 R2。</p>\n<p>这个 helper 还会从 LFS 指针里读 <code>size</code>。不然没有 hydration 的时候，一个实际 5 MB 的压缩包会被当成 130 B，资源浏览器看起来就很怪。</p>\n<p>工作流里和同步相关的部分是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">on:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">push:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">branches:</span> [<span class=\"string\">&quot;src&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">workflow_dispatch:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">inputs:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"attr\">sync_mode:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"attr\">type:</span> <span class=\"string\">choice</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"attr\">options:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">          <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">incremental</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">          <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">full</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">concurrency:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">group:</span> <span class=\"string\">hexo-deploy</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">cancel-in-progress:</span> <span class=\"literal\">false</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>Actions 菜单里没有 <code>none</code>。它只是脚本发现没有 files 改动以后自己给出的结果，所以手动重新发布页面时选 <code>incremental</code> 就行，rclone 会被跳过。第一次迁移，或者我怀疑桶里缺了东西时，再选 <code>full</code>。</p>\n<p><code>cancel-in-progress: false</code> 也很重要。完整同步用了 <code>--delete-during</code>；要是跑到一半刚删了一批旧文件，就被后一次 push 取消，后面的增量任务不会知道要把它们全补回来。让它们排队，至少 files 不会只剩半个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pages-这边留下的东西\">Pages 这边留下的东西<a title=\"#pages-这边留下的东西\" href=\"#pages-这边留下的东西\"></a></h2>\n<p>构建 job 也是 checkout <code>src</code>，但不自动拉全部 LFS。以弗所还有一个 <code>source/img/df.zip</code> 得留在 Pages，所以单独拉它：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"attr\">name:</span> <span class=\"string\">Hydrate</span> <span class=\"string\">Pages</span> <span class=\"string\">LFS</span> <span class=\"string\">asset</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">run:</span> <span class=\"string\">git</span> <span class=\"string\">lfs</span> <span class=\"string\">pull</span> <span class=\"string\">--include=&quot;source/img/df.zip&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>然后用一个普通的 Actions variable 控制要不要删 <code>public/files/</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">if</span> [ <span class=\"string\">&quot;$&#123;R2_ASSETS_ENABLED&#125;&quot;</span> <span class=\"string\">=</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span> ]<span class=\"string\">;</span> <span class=\"string\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">rm</span> <span class=\"string\">-rf</span> <span class=\"string\">public/files</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>变量在以弗所仓库 <code>Settings -&gt; Secrets and variables -&gt; Actions -&gt; Variables</code>，叫 <code>R2_ASSETS_ENABLED</code>，值填小写 <code>true</code>。刚开始先别开它：完整同步做完、<code>dl.ephesus.top</code> 和 <code>www.ephesus.top</code> 都能拿到文件之后，再打开变量重新部署。这样整个迁移期间 Pages 上原来的 <code>files/</code> 还在。</p>\n<p>变量打开后，构建 job 会确认 <code>public/files</code> 已经被删掉，再扫描 <code>public/</code> 里有没有 LFS 指针：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">if</span> [ <span class=\"string\">&quot;$&#123;R2_ASSETS_ENABLED&#125;&quot;</span> <span class=\"string\">=</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span> ] <span class=\"string\">&amp;&amp;</span> [ <span class=\"string\">-e</span> <span class=\"string\">public/files</span> ]<span class=\"string\">;</span> <span class=\"string\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;public/files must be served by R2 once migration is enabled&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">exit</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">fi</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">if</span> [ <span class=\"string\">&quot;$&#123;R2_ASSETS_ENABLED&#125;&quot;</span> <span class=\"string\">=</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span> ] <span class=\"string\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"string\">rg</span> <span class=\"string\">-l</span> <span class=\"string\">--glob</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> <span class=\"string\">\\</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">&#x27;version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1&#x27;</span> <span class=\"string\">public;</span> <span class=\"string\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Generated site contains Git LFS pointer files&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"string\">exit</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>真要回退也简单，把变量删掉或改成别的值，再跑一次构建。Pages 会重新带上 <code>public/files/</code>，R2 里的文件还在，Worker 也不用急着删。</p>\n<h2 id=\"要配的-secrets\">要配的 secrets<a title=\"#要配的-secrets\" href=\"#要配的-secrets\"></a></h2>\n<p>GitHub Actions 里放以下 Repository secrets：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>R2_ACCOUNT_ID</code>：Cloudflare Account ID。</li>\n<li><code>R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID</code>：R2 API Token 生成的 Access Key ID。</li>\n<li><code>R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</code>：同一组 R2 凭据的 Secret Access Key。</li>\n<li><code>CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID</code>：给 Wrangler 部署 Worker 用的 Account ID，当前和 <code>R2_ACCOUNT_ID</code> 一样。</li>\n<li><code>CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN</code>：给 Wrangler 的 Cloudflare API Token。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R2 的 Access Key 在 Cloudflare R2 API token 页面创建。权限选 <code>Object Read &amp; Write</code>，资源范围只选 <code>ephesus-files</code>。Worker 另外用一个 token，至少给 Workers Scripts 编辑、Workers R2 Storage 编辑和 <code>ephesus.top</code> 的 Workers Routes 编辑权限。分两个 token 没什么神秘理由，单纯是一个泄露了也别把另一个权限一块交出去。</p>\n<p>rclone 的 R2 配置从 Actions 环境变量读：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">R2_REMOTE:</span> <span class=\"string\">r2:ephesus-files/files</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_TYPE:</span> <span class=\"string\">s3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_PROVIDER:</span> <span class=\"string\">Cloudflare</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID:</span> <span class=\"string\">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class=\"string\">secrets.R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID</span> <span class=\"string\">&#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY:</span> <span class=\"string\">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class=\"string\">secrets.R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</span> <span class=\"string\">&#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_ENDPOINT:</span> <span class=\"string\">https://$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class=\"string\">secrets.R2_ACCOUNT_ID</span> <span class=\"string\">&#125;&#125;.r2.cloudflarestorage.com</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_REGION:</span> <span class=\"string\">auto</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_FORCE_PATH_STYLE:</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"中间踩到的两个-rclone-坑\">中间踩到的两个 rclone 坑<a title=\"#中间踩到的两个-rclone-坑\" href=\"#中间踩到的两个-rclone-坑\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bucket-检查\">bucket 检查<a title=\"#bucket-检查\" href=\"#bucket-检查\"></a></h3>\n<p>R2 key 限制到 <code>ephesus-files</code> 后，rclone 还想列出整个账户的 bucket，权限就不够。同步脚本最后改成只列目标前缀：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">rclone lsf r2:ephesus-files/files --max-depth 1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>并加上：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_NO_CHECK_BUCKET:</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>如果这里写 <code>rclone lsd r2:</code>，token 需要有列出账户所有 bucket 的权限。既然我特意把 token 限到一个桶，再让它要求这个权限就有点本末倒置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"notimplemented:-not-implemented\"><code>NotImplemented: Not Implemented</code><a title=\"#notimplemented:-not-implemented\" href=\"#notimplemented:-not-implemented\"></a></h3>\n<p>第一次跑 <code>full</code> 时，日志里刷出了好多 <code>NotImplemented</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ERROR : rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png: Failed to copy:</span><br><span class=\"line\">NotImplemented: Not Implemented</span><br><span class=\"line\">status code: 501</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>刚看到 738 个报错的时候真的有点崩溃，不过传输进度还在走。仔细看才发现，问题不在文件本身，出在 rclone 上传前的 HEAD 检查。R2 对还不存在的对象返回 501，rclone 于是给每个要上传的文件都记一次错误。</p>\n<p>配置里加上：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">RCLONE_CONFIG_R2_NO_HEAD:</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;true&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>再跑一次 <code>full</code> 就完成了。这个报错看着很像几百个文件全坏了，实际是 rclone 的预检和 R2 在这个地方没对上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"actions-里找不到-worker\">Actions 里找不到 Worker<a title=\"#actions-里找不到-worker\" href=\"#actions-里找不到-worker\"></a></h2>\n<p>Worker 还有个单独的 <code>Deploy files proxy Worker</code> 工作流：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">on:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">workflow_dispatch:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">jobs:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">deploy:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">runs-on:</span> <span class=\"string\">ubuntu-latest</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">steps:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"attr\">uses:</span> <span class=\"string\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"attr\">with:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">          <span class=\"attr\">ref:</span> <span class=\"string\">src</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"attr\">working-directory:</span> <span class=\"string\">workers/ephesus-files-proxy</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"attr\">run:</span> <span class=\"string\">npx</span> <span class=\"string\">--yes</span> <span class=\"string\">wrangler@4</span> <span class=\"string\">deploy</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>我第一次去 Actions 页面时根本没看见它。GitHub 的 <code>workflow_dispatch</code> 有个限制：工作流文件得在默认分支，按钮才会出现。以弗所默认分支是 <code>main</code>，源码却放 <code>src</code>，这里又卡了一下。</p>\n<p>解决办法是把这份很短的工作流定义也留到 <code>main</code>。运行时还是 <code>checkout ref: src</code>，所以 Worker 源码依旧只认 <code>src</code>。之后在 <code>Actions -&gt; Deploy files proxy Worker -&gt; Run workflow</code> 里选 <code>src</code> 就能部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下次要重来一遍\">下次要重来一遍<a title=\"#下次要重来一遍\" href=\"#下次要重来一遍\"></a></h2>\n<p>以后要重做这套流程，按下面的顺序来：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>创建 R2 桶，绑定 <code>dl.ephesus.top</code>，配好 Worker 路由和 GitHub secrets。</li>\n<li>保持 <code>R2_ASSETS_ENABLED</code> 未设置，手动运行 <code>Build Hexo and Deploy to main</code>，<code>sync_mode</code> 选 <code>full</code>。</li>\n<li>先检查普通图片、LFS 压缩包和 H5 的入口文件：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">curl -I https://dl.ephesus.top/files/rl/adom/adomgb/tiles/item319.png</span><br><span class=\"line\">curl -I https://dl.ephesus.top/files/hxh_civ/3D%20Art.zip</span><br><span class=\"line\">curl -I https://dl.ephesus.top/files/leyliner/index.html</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>跑 <code>Deploy files proxy Worker</code>，再用 <code>www.ephesus.top/files/...</code> 检查一次，并测 Range：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">curl -i -H &#x27;Range: bytes=0-15&#x27; \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  https://www.ephesus.top/files/hxh_civ/3D%20Art.zip</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>这里正常会返回 <code>206 Partial Content</code> 和 <code>Content-Range</code>。</p>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li>设置 <code>R2_ASSETS_ENABLED=true</code>，重新跑构建工作流。以后 push 到 <code>src</code>，它会先做增量同步，再发布页面。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>到这里，平时的操作和以前没什么区别：文件照旧放 <code>source/files/</code>，commit、push。以弗所发布时，R2 和 Worker 负责 <code>files/</code>，Pages 只需要发布页面。</p>\n","next":{"title":"NetHack 首次飞升经历","link":"2026/nethack-first-ascension"},"plink":"http://www.ephesus.top/2026/git-lfs-r2-github-pages/","toc":[{"id":"files/-得一起搬","title":"files&#x2F; 得一起搬","index":"1"},{"id":"worker-做了什么","title":"Worker 做了什么","index":"2"},{"id":"actions-怎样同步","title":"Actions 怎样同步","index":"3"},{"id":"pages-这边留下的东西","title":"Pages 这边留下的东西","index":"4"},{"id":"要配的-secrets","title":"要配的 secrets","index":"5"},{"id":"中间踩到的两个-rclone-坑","title":"中间踩到的两个 rclone 坑","index":"6","children":[{"id":"bucket-检查","title":"bucket 检查","index":"6.1"},{"id":"notimplemented:-not-implemented","title":"NotImplemented: Not Implemented","index":"6.2"}]},{"id":"actions-里找不到-worker","title":"Actions 里找不到 Worker","index":"7"},{"id":"下次要重来一遍","title":"下次要重来一遍","index":"8"}],"reward":true,"reading_time":"3023 words in 20 min"}